2026-09-04 13:23:34.518 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	101	4734960	456486	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffcb967dBooprikt^-: ^0xffd7c8a0We needed rest to succeed. We had to take the chance.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:34.518 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	102	4734960	456486	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7I guess I should be used to sleeping with both eyes open. I don't deal with this well. We're alike because of Gorion, but I prefer being in the background.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:35.132 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	103	4734960	457100	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffcb967dBooprikt^-: ^0xffd7c8a0Do you remember much about him? My memory is still fuzzy.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:35.132 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	104	4734960	457100	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7He was a great mage, and supposedly a great adventurer. It's funny; we lived with him for years, and Jaheira seems to know more about him.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:35.858 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	105	4734960	457826	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffd6bd9fJaheira^-: ^0xffbed7d7Nonsense, he was secretive with everyone. We just had... mutual acquaintances.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:36.360 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	106	4734960	458327	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7I guess he was a big friend of the Harpers. Even got a visit from Khelben "Blackstaff" once. Real powerful mage. Talked to Gorion like an equal.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:36.771 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	107	4734960	458738	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7I wish we could go back to those days, before all this fuss and bother. Before I learned... Well, we've seen so much. Candlekeep seems so small now.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:38.618 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	108	4734960	460585	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffcb967dBooprikt^-: ^0xffd7c8a0Yes, but then to me it always did. It was home, but I outgrew it.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:38.618 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	109	4734960	460585	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7Funny, that. I was sorry to go, but I couldn't let you wander off on your own, now could I? After Gorion d... died, you needed all the help you could get.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:39.230 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	110	4734960	461198	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7Not that I'm much help right now. My head still aches, and I keep seeing things. Too much death around here, everywhere. It's in everything, even me.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:39.611 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	111	4734960	461578	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7We won't be able to just walk away, you know. The guy that captured us... he knows about you. He said something about potential, something about great power.^-
2026-09-04 13:23:39.987 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[46832:118371270] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	112	4734960	461954	Day 0, Hour 17 (2 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffffb3f3Imoen^-: ^0xffbed7d7Booprikt, say we won't look back. I don't care if he can "tap the power" or access whatever avatar stuff. We've gotta get away from all this death.^-
